	"description": "Single source of truth for the analytics constants shared by the TypeScript server/web and the Kotlin mobile analytics. Edit this file, then run `bun run constants:generate` to regenerate src/lib/analytics/constants.generated.ts and mobile/shared/.../analytics/GeneratedAnalyticsConstants.kt. CI fails if the generated files drift (constants:check). DII rows are the overall inflammatory effect score, global daily mean intake and SD from Table 2 of Shivappa et al. 2014 (PMC3925198); caffeine is tabulated in g there, so mg intakes are divided by caffeineMgPerTableUnit before scoring. fullIndexAbsCoefficientSum is the sum of |effect score| over all 45 published parameters, used to scale the +/-1 classification cut-points to the subset this app measures. RDA rows carry the IOM RDA (or AI/CDRR where no RDA exists, see referenceType) and the EAR where one is defined, adults 19-50; fiber is the 14 g/1000 kcal AI.",
